{"4591130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Empty Heaven: Liminal Dream", "steam_appid": 4591130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/afec932de1e134526c96b1deee194a4c.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/afec932de1e134526c96b1deee194a4c.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/afec932de1e134526c96b1deee194a4c.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> interconnected liminal spaces through a shifting house that opens the way to impossible dream worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe</strong> subtle changes in the environment, revisit familiar places, and uncover paths that were never there before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen</strong> carefully to unsettling sounds, distant echoes, and fragile clues hidden in the silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> strange objects, cryptic evidence, and details that slowly reveal a deeper mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter</strong> uncanny entities that do not hunt you, but make every space feel wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend</strong> through a psychological horror experience inspired by Backrooms and Dreamcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience</strong> horror without jumpscares or chase sequences, built instead on dread, emptiness, and the feeling of being lost inside a dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/5b2769abd00fec6a2e02b3d051ac0b13.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/5b2769abd00fec6a2e02b3d051ac0b13.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/5b2769abd00fec6a2e02b3d051ac0b13.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A house that shouldn't be there.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each liminal dream echoes a single house that connects everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Its rooms shift over time. Doors appear where they should not exist. Familiar spaces lead to impossible places. The deeper you go, the more the house becomes a reflection of something far beyond understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/040f2d17cbc51d16e9dab20bf9200096.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/040f2d17cbc51d16e9dab20bf9200096.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/040f2d17cbc51d16e9dab20bf9200096.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Discover the secrets of the world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Collect, inspect, combine, and interact are rewarded with progression.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Look closely. Notice what changed. Revisit spaces. Follow visual details, distant sounds, and fragments of meaning. Every new discovery draws you deeper into a world that feels both nostalgic and deeply wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/46e4c053af5818ee6dd23d1bf2585296.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/46e4c053af5818ee6dd23d1bf2585296.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/46e4c053af5818ee6dd23d1bf2585296.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You must always remember.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dreams are fragile memories. Still, what you discover stays with you.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Clues, entities, places, and fragments slowly come together in your memory, preserving each discovery as you piece together the hidden truth behind the dream and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/7871650f1388f89441745769fa994731.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/7871650f1388f89441745769fa994731.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/7871650f1388f89441745769fa994731.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Liminal Horror, silent nightmare.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No jumpscares. No chases. Only the courage to keep going.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey of silence, absence, and the feeling of emptiness. There is nothing screaming at you to run, only silent nightmares, oppressive spaces, and the unsettling need to face them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/afec932de1e134526c96b1deee194a4c.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/afec932de1e134526c96b1deee194a4c.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/afec932de1e134526c96b1deee194a4c.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> interconnected liminal spaces through a shifting house that opens the way to impossible dream worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe</strong> subtle changes in the environment, revisit familiar places, and uncover paths that were never there before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen</strong> carefully to unsettling sounds, distant echoes, and fragile clues hidden in the silence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> strange objects, cryptic evidence, and details that slowly reveal a deeper mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter</strong> uncanny entities that do not hunt you, but make every space feel wrong.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend</strong> through a psychological horror experience inspired by Backrooms and Dreamcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience</strong> horror without jumpscares or chase sequences, built instead on dread, emptiness, and the feeling of being lost inside a dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/5b2769abd00fec6a2e02b3d051ac0b13.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/5b2769abd00fec6a2e02b3d051ac0b13.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/5b2769abd00fec6a2e02b3d051ac0b13.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>A house that shouldn't be there.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Each liminal dream echoes a single house that connects everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Its rooms shift over time. Doors appear where they should not exist. Familiar spaces lead to impossible places. The deeper you go, the more the house becomes a reflection of something far beyond understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/040f2d17cbc51d16e9dab20bf9200096.poster.avif?t=1