am and the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/7871650f1388f89441745769fa994731.poster.avif?t=1786469267\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/7871650f1388f89441745769fa994731.webm?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/extras/7871650f1388f89441745769fa994731.mp4?t=1786469267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Liminal Horror, silent nightmare.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No jumpscares. No chases. Only the courage to keep going.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Journey of silence, absence, and the feeling of emptiness. There is nothing screaming at you to run, only silent nightmares, oppressive spaces, and the unsettling need to face them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You are a woman exploring liminal spaces as if wandering through a dream, searching for those you lost. Uncover the mystery connecting these ever-shifting realities. No jumpscares or chases. Inspired by Dreamcore and the Backrooms.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/2d29a1709bcc215199e2ee42780bf2058300d105/header.jpg?t=1786469267", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4591130/c6c34739a52f6b33212f56160b95222c1c0f0873/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786469267", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/